# Chandra, Awakened Inferno: "This spell can't be countered." Bot2's Force of Will (exiling Brainstorm, paying 1 life) targets
# the Chandra spell and resolves, but she is not countered (CR 101.2) and enters. "+2: Each opponent gets an emblem with 'At the
# beginning of your upkeep, this emblem deals 1 damage to you.'" (CR 114.2): the emblem is Bot2's, so it triggers in Bot2's
# upkeep and not Bot1's. Turn 2: Bot2 takes 1 (19 after Force of Will, then 18). Turn 3: Bot1's own upkeep deals Bot1 nothing,
# and a second +2 gives Bot2 a second emblem, whose trigger is separate. Turn 4: Bot2 takes 2 more (16).

